{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_47_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_47","textTraditional":"一、十有八年，春，王三月，日有食之。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_47_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_47","textTraditional":"不言日，不言朔，夜食也。何以知其夜食也？曰，王者朝日，故雖為天子，必有尊也。貴為諸侯，必有長也。故天子朝日，諸侯朝朔。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_47_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_47","textTraditional":"二、夏，公追戎於濟西。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_47_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_47","textTraditional":"其不言戎之伐我何也？以公之追之，不使戎邇於我也。於濟西者，大之也。何大焉？為公之追之也。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_47_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_47","textTraditional":"三、秋，有蜮。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_47_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_47","textTraditional":"一有一亡曰有。蜮，射人者也。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_47_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_47","textTraditional":"四、冬，十月。","sentenceOrder":7}],"overrides":{}}